CORE
disable_iff_repeat_past.sv
--top top --new-ic3 --buechi --witness-lasso 12
^\[top\.good\] .*: PROVED$
^\[top\.wrong_data\] .*: REFUTED$
^\[top\.aborted\] .*: PROVED$
^\[top\.antecedent\] .*: PROVED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A named sequence contains a fixed repetition, a delay chain, and distinct multi-cycle history in antecedent and consequent.
